  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Co-creation of Knowledge Climate Adaptation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-creating knowledge for local adaptation to climate change in LDCs. Activities include developing capacity on research and educational programs that focuses on vulnerable communities facing diverse climate risks, adopting bottom-up approaches to knowledge co-creation.</narrative>
  </description>
